{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130050/extras/3eb20c1b51bd4f5161828483414e9f47.avif?t=1758270839\" width=512 height=264 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUMANITY VS AI: THE LAST STAND.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surface belongs to the machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mechanized army, towering spiders, and kamikaze drones, all driven by an advanced AI.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise from the underground in weaponized war rigs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claw through cyberpunk cities, abandoned moon bases, and nuclear powered facilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op warfare: missiles, energy weapons, nuclear EMPs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is humanity\u2019s last ride.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130050/extras/ccd3a7ade734b5de4fd55c9537e9a430.avif?t=1758270839\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR WAR MACHINE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge parts. Reinforce your rig.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap machine guns, rocket launchers, railguns, energy rifles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your armor and employ experimental tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune for speed, firepower, or survival.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE THE AI ARMY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mech spiders, Kamikaze bots, aerial drone patrols, 4-legged enemies, androids, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinated swarm tactics that adapt and flank.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colossal boss machines with city-crushing weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They evolve. They learn. They will not stop.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130050/extras/1a234ac25001e3d10024ae431a597fc7.avif?t=1758270839\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP STRIKE MISSIONS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-player online co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounties and military rank upgrades for highest number of kills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice chat integrated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate diversions, flanks, and ambushes on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain attacks for devastating combos.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST. BRUTAL. RELENTLESS.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed chases and sudden reversals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight driving, explosive combat, quick restarts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is a last chance at survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130050/extras/cf1cd882bc2eb51c116a1003fe050654.avif?t=1758270839\" width=512 height=266 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE SOUND OF WAR</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom soundtrack with underground pulse-pounding electronic music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next-gen sound design</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMING SOON TO PC, MAC, AND Steam Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surface is ash. The machines are waiting.<br>Suit up, strap in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And hit the gas.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Resistance on Discord</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mech Shock is currently in closed beta. If you are interested in playing reach out to us on our studio website or on our Twitter page.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2130050?t=1758270839","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130050/7e0d8a6c72c591d73bafafd7eec240d47e9f2af9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758270839","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130050/46484a4b8af840437d19b323e785431e52cc675d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758270839","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130050/46484a4b8af840437d19b323e785431e52cc675d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758270839","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Vehicle combat game where vehicles fight a mech army. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130050/extras/3eb20c1b51bd4f5161828483414e9f47.avif?t=1758270839\" width=512 height=264 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUMANITY VS AI: THE LAST STAND.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surface belongs to the machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mechanized army, towering spiders, and kamikaze drones, all driven by an advanced AI.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise from the underground in weaponized war rigs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claw through cyberpunk cities, abandoned moon bases, and nuclear powered facilities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op warfare: missiles, energy weapons, nuclear EMPs