ombos.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST. BRUTAL. RELENTLESS.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-speed chases and sudden reversals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight driving, explosive combat, quick restarts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is a last chance at survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130050/extras/cf1cd882bc2eb51c116a1003fe050654.avif?t=1758270839\" width=512 height=266 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE SOUND OF WAR</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom soundtrack with underground pulse-pounding electronic music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next-gen sound design</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMING SOON TO PC, MAC, AND Steam Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surface is ash. The machines are waiting.<br>Suit up, strap in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And hit the gas.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Resistance on Discord</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mech Shock is currently in closed beta. If you are interested in playing reach out to us on our studio website or on our Twitter page.</p>","developers":["Superframe"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2130050/16a52e55e0fa960af6b0cdee8ef6a722ab29b99e/header.jpg?t=1758270839","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025 Alien  Science, All RIghts Reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_req